sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Stripe
    participant API as Your API
    participant DB as Database

    S->>API: POST /webhooks/stripe + Stripe-Signature header
    API->>API: HMAC-SHA256 verify (constant-time)
    alt Invalid
        API-->>S: 400 Bad Request
    else Valid
        API->>DB: Process event (idempotent)
        API-->>S: 200 OK
    end
